[? if kpd_candidate = spd_candidate: 共产党如今退出我们此前的联盟,转而支持他们自己的候选人。 ?]


@r2_endorse_gessler
title: 把我们的支持转向奥托·格斯勒。
view-if: ddp_candidate = "Gessler" and spd_candidate != ddp_candidate
on-departure: kpd_candidate = "Thälmann" if kpd_candidate == spd_candidate and kpd_party_leader != "Conciliators"; kpd_candidate = "Münzenberg" if kpd_candidate == spd_candidate and kpd_party_leader == "Conciliators"; sapd_candidate = kpd_candidate; spd_candidate = "Gessler"; ddp_relation += 4; dvp_candidate = "Seldte" if dvp_relation < 40; is_unity_candidate = 1
go-to: r2_campaigning

我们表态支持奥托·格斯勒 —— 他曾是民主党人,如今为独立人士。

[? if dvp_relation < 40 : 由于我们支持格斯勒,人民党中支持他的那一部分已脱离出去,转而支持泽尔特。 ?]

[? if kpd_candidate = spd_candidate: 共产党如今退出我们此前的联盟,转而支持他们自己的候选人。 ?]



@r2_endorse_eckener
title: 说服魏玛联盟各党团结在胡戈·埃克纳身后。
subtitle: -2 资源
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources < 2 : -2 资源 —— 资源不足。 ?]
choose-if: resources >= 2 and ((z_relation >= 50 and z_leader = "Kaas") or (z_relation >= 30 and z_leader = "Joos")) and ddp_relation >= 40
view-if: z_candidate = "Adenauer" and ddp_candidate = "Gessler" and spd_candidate != "Eckener"
on-arrival: kpd_candidate = "Thälmann" if kpd_candidate == spd_candidate and kpd_party_leader != "Conciliators"; kpd_candidate = "Münzenberg" if kpd_candidate == spd_candidate and kpd_party_leader == "Conciliators"; sapd_candidate = kpd_candidate; spd_candidate = "Eckener"; z_candidate = "Eckener"; ddp_candidate = "Eckener"; resources -= 2; is_unity_candidate = 1
go-to: r2_campaigning

我们成功把魏玛联盟各党团结在胡戈·埃克纳身后!



@r2_campaigning
view-if: round = 1

- @convince_z_unity
- @convince_z_spd
- @convince_ddp_unity
- @convince_ddp_spd
- @convince_dvp_spd
- @convince_dvp_unity
- @convince_kpd_spd
